              "quote": "unsigned long ZEXPORT crc32_z(crc, buf, len)\n    unsigned long crc;\n    const unsigned char FAR *buf;\n    z_size_t len;\n{\n    if (buf == Z_NULL) return 0UL;\n"
            },
            {
              "evidence_id": "loc-cd28ee32f9f24c3c39df20fe",
              "quote": "    /* in case user likes doing a byte at a time, keep it fast */\n    if (len == 1) {\n        adler += buf[0];\n        if (adler >= BASE)\n            adler -= BASE;\n        sum2 += adler;\n        if (sum2 >= BASE)\n            sum2 -= BASE;\n        return adler | (sum2 << 16);\n    }\n\n    /* initial Adler-32 value (deferred check for len == 1 speed) */\n    if (buf == Z_NULL)\n        return 1L;\n"
            }
          ]
        },
